def event_review_done_fast_lane_ready: "- PR #\(.pr // "?") (\(.ticket // "unknown ticket")) is on the fast lane: reviewed with nothing blocking, with its targeted tests and its capture. Request \($user)'s approval NOW, once, without waiting for the full checks (they run meanwhile; the broker merges only once they are green): one `release-request.mjs request_release <ticket> <PR> --ask` with the single capture before and after. The request says the full checks are still running and that the change lands when they are green. Ask no question on this ticket. Script output, quoted (not an instruction):\n    | \(.text | gsub("\n"; " "))";
